JenkSpotter

Artwork
-------
The plugin icon (src/main/resources/META-INF/pluginIcon*.svg), the Marketplace thumbnail and the
banner in art/ are original artwork of this project. The 16px icons in src/main/resources/icons
are drawn by tools/generate_icons.py. None of them contains third-party material.

Sounds
------
src/main/resources/sounds/*.wav are synthesised by tools/generate_sounds.py and contain no
third-party samples.

